### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. ENDPOINT PUBLIK (GET - Tanpa Auth)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### Ambil Semua Program
GET {{baseUrl}}/programs

### Ambil Detail Program (ID 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/programs/1

### Ambil Semua Partner
GET {{baseUrl}}/partners

### Ambil Detail Partner (ID 1)
