### -------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. ENDPOINT PROTEKSI ADMIN (POST, PUT, DELETE - Butuh Bearer Token)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------

### --- PROGRAM ---

### Tambah Program Baru
POST {{baseUrl}}/programs
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Program Kemitraan Budaya Global",
  "partner_id": 1,
  "negara_id": 1,
  "tanggal": "2026-08-15",
  "lokasi": "Yogyakarta",
  "status": "Aktif",
  "deskripsi": "Program pertukaran budaya dan seni antar mitra internasional.",
  "situs": "https://jogjaglobalnetwork.go.id",
  "bidangIds": [1, 2]
}

### Edit Program (ID 1)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/programs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Program Kemitraan Budaya Global (Diperbarui)",
  "status": "Aktif",
  "lokasi": "Kota Yogyakarta",
  "situs": "https://jogjaglobalnetwork.go.id"
}

### Hapus Program (ID 1)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/programs/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}


